Zara sochiye… duniya mein do hi tarah ke log hote hain.
Ek woh… jo har waqt complain karte rehte hain…
Aur doosre woh… jo apni zindagi ka control khud lete hain.
Farq sirf ek cheez ka hai… aadatein.
Aaj main aapko ek aisi kitaab ke golden rules batane ja raha hoon…
Jo duniya ke sabse successful leaders aur CEOs follow karte hain.
Naam hai… The 7 Habits of Highly Effective People by Stephen Covey.
Toh chaliye shuru karte hain… aur dekhte hain woh 7 aadatein… jo aapka mustaqbil shape karengi.
Habit number one: Be Proactive – Zimmedari lo.
Zyada tar log apne failures ko blame karte hain doosron par.
Lekin proactive log kehte hain: “I am responsible.”
Ek chhoti kahani:
Do dost ek hi traffic jam mein phans gaye.
Pehla dost ghussa karta hai, mood kharab kar leta hai.
Doosra dost audiobook sunta hai, relax rehta hai.
Situation same thi… farq tha soch ka.
Lesson: Apni energy us cheez par lagao jo aapke control mein hai.
Jo control mein nahi… use chhod do.
Habit number two: Begin With the End in Mind – Socho akhirat se.
Sabse bada loss hai mehnat karna… galat direction mein.
Successful log pehle apna end goal imagine karte hain.
Socho: Agar aapki zindagi ki kitaab likhi jaye… last page par kya likha hoga?
“Bas guzarta gaya…” ya “Duniya par asar dala.”
Lesson: Har din ek vision ke sath jeeyo. Clarity sabse badi power hai.
Habit number three: Put First Things First – Tarjeeh do.
Sab kehte hain mere paas waqt nahi… asal masla hai priorities.
Stephen Covey ek matrix dete hain:
- Urgent aur important kaam
- Non-urgent lekin important kaam
- Aur waste of time kaam
Lesson: Apna time un cheezon par lagao jo future banati hain – learning, health, relationships.
Think Win-Win – Dono ki jeet.
Hamari society mein log sochte hain: Meri jeet, doosre ka loss.
Lekin successful log hamesha win-win approach rakhte hain.
Example: Cake share karna.
Tum choose karo piece, main doosra le lunga.
Trust banta hai.
Lesson: Real success tab aati hai jab dono ki jeet ho.
Habit number five: Seek First to Understand, Then to Be Understood – Pehle samajho.
Zyada tar log sunte hain sirf jawab dene ke liye.
Lekin asli leaders samajhne ke liye sunte hain.
Doctor bina symptoms samjhe dawa de de… kya wo effective hoga?
Nahi.
Lesson: Jab tak aap doosron ka dard nahi samajhoge… aapka message dil ko nahi lagega.
Habit number six: Synergize – Teamwork.
Ek lakdi todna aasaan hai… lekin 10 lakdi ek sath bandhi ho toh mushkil.
Yehi hai synergy.
Jahan alag log apni strength laayein… aur mil kar kuch naya create karein.
Jaise ek band orchestra – alag instruments, lekin ek melody.
Lesson: Teamwork… competition se zyada powerful hai.
Habit number seven: Sharpen the Saw – Apne aap ko nikharo.
Ek lakadhara din bhar lakdi kaat raha hai… lekin aarhi blunt ho gayi.
Result? Zyada mehnat, kam faida.
Waise hi hum busy rehte hain… lekin growth ke liye time nahi nikalte.
Lesson: Self-care, learning, exercise, spirituality – yeh sab aarhi ko tez karna hai.
Dosto… yeh thi Stephen Covey ki 7 habits… jo duniya ke sabse effective logon ka raaz hain.
Aap inhe apply karo… aur dekho kaise aapki zindagi transform hoti hai.
Agar yeh video pasand aayi… toh apne doston ke sath share karein.
Aur comment mein likhein – kaunsi habit aap pehle apnane wale hain?
Main hoon aapka dost…
Phir milte hain ek naye inspiring topic ke sath.
Allah Hafiz.
